// IntroString :
"P241312636" "Alright, {HeroName}, you want to help the Vanguard?  First, here is the rules: <br><br>1 - If you do not like the way we run things, then that is too bad.  We are sure you can find something else to do. <br>2 - We are always going to have something for you to do.  If you do not like what is available, see rule number 1. <br>3 - We only reward success.  Mama raised us to have a high standard.  Unlike Lev. <br>Oh, and rule 4 - We work on a tight schedule, so everything but the hunting tasks is going to be timed. <br><br>Now that we are clear, if you are still interested, let us see if you've got what it takes."
// AcceptString :
"P3715262224" "Prove yourself to Borea"
// SendOffString :
"P2888516335" "Good.  We will give you an easy one.  The Rikti have taken over an abandoned building near the base.  Your target is their leader.  You have 30 minutes to take him out.  Good luck.<br><br><color orange>You have 30 minutes to complete this mission.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2964844595" "Defeat Rikti Leader"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3038310682" "Look, if you don't do this right the first time, you will have to do it again.  Now get moving."

